1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
一碗牛奶，凭一层"皮"封神
A bowl of milk — famous for its skin.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,700
它必须用水牛的奶
It must be water-buffalo milk.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:07,100
水牛奶更浓，脂肪更高
Thicker, fattier than cow's milk.

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,500
炖滚放凉，结出第一层皮
Simmer, cool — the first skin forms.

5
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,900
轻轻倒出牛奶，皮留碗底
Pour off the milk, keep the skin.

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,300
加蛋清和糖，再倒回去
Add egg white and sugar, pour back.

7
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,700
二次炖，结出第二层皮
Steam again — a second skin.

8
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,100
所以叫"双皮"奶
That's why: double-skin milk.

9
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,500
1925年，顺德大良的一次意外
A 1925 accident in Shunde.

10
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:24,300
如今，是广东省的非遗手艺
Now a provincial heritage craft.

11
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,700
一勺下去，滑过两层皮
One spoon, through two silky skins.

12
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:29,200
关注，带你吃遍广东糖水
Follow — I'll tour all of Canton's sweets.

13
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:31,600
下集：牛奶被姜一"撞"，20秒凝住
Next: ginger sets milk in 20 seconds.
